---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "BoroJeet Promotions: All Bonuses and Offers"
description: "Explore all promotions and bonuses available for players in Bangladesh at BoroJeet. Updated daily with the latest offers."
date: 2025-11-09
---

<div class="wrap py-6 md:py-10">
  <div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-12">
    <h1 class="h1 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-cyan-400">BoroJeet Promotions & Bonus Offers</h1>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-muted">Discover all the exciting bonuses and offers available at BoroJeet.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="promo-page-container">
    <!-- Category Quick Filter -->
    <div class="promo-filter-wrapper sticky top-[60px] z-40 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap gap-2 py-3 px-4 scrollbar-hide">
        {% for category in promotions.all %}
          <a href="#{{ category.slug }}" class="inline-block px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold bg-gray-700/50 text-text rounded-full hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 flex-shrink-0">{{ category.category }}</a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% for category in promotions.all %}
      <section id="{{ category.slug }}" class="promo-category-wrapper scroll-mt-24 mb-8">
        <div class="mb-6 md:mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-4">
            <a href="{{ '/promotions/' + category.slug + '/' | url }}" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">{{ category.category }}</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-md text-muted mt-2 pl-5">{{ category.description }}</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6">
          {% for item in category.items %}
            <a href="{{ '/promotions/' + category.slug + '/' + item.slug + '/' | url }}" class="group block bg-card border border-gray-700/50 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-400/20 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1">
              <div class="relative">
                <img src="{{ item.image | url }}" alt="{{ item.title }}" class="w-full h-48 object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent"></div>
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-4">
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white leading-tight">{{ item.title }}</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4">
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">{{ item.details }}</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
}
.scrollbar-hide {
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    scrollbar-width: none;
}

/* Styles for visual separation */
.promo-filter-wrapper {
  background: rgba(23, 31, 47, 0.85); /* Darker, more opaque background */
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.7);
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(75, 85, 99, 0.9); /* Brighter top border */
  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); /* Deeper shadow */
  padding: 4px 0; /* Add some vertical padding */
}

.promo-category-wrapper {
  background: #111827; /* Solid dark background, slightly lighter than pure black */
  border: 1px solid #374151; /* A bit more visible border */
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); /* Stronger shadow */
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.promo-category-wrapper:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px);
  box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); /* Enhanced hover shadow */
}
</style>
